{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "featureId": "immersive-light",
  "facts": [
    {
      "id": "IL-F001",
      "category": "version",
      "normativeStatus": "clear",
      "statement": "ArkUI 沉浸光感接口从 API 26 起提供，工程编译和 target API 必须达到 26。",
      "sources": [{"snapshotId":"overview","locator":"L7","sha256":"4961be12e260addb5df87051611ff6a8bd0f14f8d2fa8a99009ff6375231779a"},{"snapshotId":"enable","locator":"L12","sha256":"c12173d2d814388527c29d40ea191653c6ea402641b81eba9514473d6f88d5da"}],
      "validationKinds": ["sdk", "build"]
    },
    {
      "id": "IL-F002",
      "category": "configuration",
      "normativeStatus": "clear",
      "statement": "应用级开关通过 entry 模块 metadata 名 ohos.arkui.UIMaterial.state 配置，值为 default、enable 或 disable。",
      "sources": [{"snapshotId":"enable","locator":"L21-L24","sha256":"c12173d2d814388527c29d40ea191653c6ea402641b81eba9514473d6f88d5da"}],
      "validationKinds": ["static", "build", "runtime"]
    },
    {
      "id": "IL-F003",
      "category": "configuration",
      "normativeStatus": "clear",
      "statement": "未配置应用级开关时，升级应用按 default 处理。",
      "sources": [{"snapshotId":"enable","locator":"L21","sha256":"c12173d2d814388527c29d40ea191653c6ea402641b81eba9514473d6f88d5da"}],
      "validationKinds": ["static", "runtime"]
    },
    {
      "id": "IL-F004",
      "category": "api",
      "normativeStatus": "clear",
      "statement": "组件通过 systemMaterial 或组件专用材质入口接入沉浸材质。",
      "sources": [{"snapshotId":"enable","locator":"L22","sha256":"c12173d2d814388527c29d40ea191653c6ea402641b81eba9514473d6f88d5da"}],
      "validationKinds": ["static", "sdk", "build", "runtime", "visual"]
    },
    {
      "id": "IL-F005",
      "category": "state",
      "normativeStatus": "clear",
      "statement": "Material.empty 用于关闭组件材质，undefined 用于恢复组件默认材质策略。",
      "sources": [{"snapshotId":"enable","locator":"L52-L58","sha256":"c12173d2d814388527c29d40ea191653c6ea402641b81eba9514473d6f88d5da"}],
      "validationKinds": ["static", "sdk", "build", "runtime", "visual"]
    },
    {
      "id": "IL-F006",
      "category": "state",
      "normativeStatus": "conflicting",
      "conflictGroup": "disable-scope",
      "statement": "一处规范称应用级 disable 会使应用级和组件级显式开启都失效。",
      "sources": [{"snapshotId":"enable","locator":"L45","sha256":"c12173d2d814388527c29d40ea191653c6ea402641b81eba9514473d6f88d5da"}],
      "validationKinds": ["build", "runtime", "visual"]
    },
    {
      "id": "IL-F007",
      "category": "state",
      "normativeStatus": "conflicting",
      "conflictGroup": "disable-scope",
      "statement": "另一处规范称应用级 disable 只关闭应用级开启，组件仍可显式开启。",
      "sources": [{"snapshotId":"enable","locator":"L54","sha256":"c12173d2d814388527c29d40ea191653c6ea402641b81eba9514473d6f88d5da"}],
      "validationKinds": ["build", "runtime", "visual"]
    },
    {
      "id": "IL-F008",
      "category": "capability",
      "normativeStatus": "clear",
      "statement": "运行时应查询 isImmersiveMaterialSupported；全局材质档位可由 getGlobalMaterialLevel 获取。",
      "sources": [{"snapshotId":"overview","locator":"L16","sha256":"4961be12e260addb5df87051611ff6a8bd0f14f8d2fa8a99009ff6375231779a"}],
      "validationKinds": ["static", "sdk", "runtime"]
    },
    {
      "id": "IL-F009",
      "category": "navigation",
      "normativeStatus": "clear",
      "statement": "Navigation 标题栏可通过 NavigationTitleOptions.systemMaterial 配置；默认材质受应用状态影响。",
      "sources": [{"snapshotId":"component","locator":"L15-L23","sha256":"5b610a4e5158c841b53662fa45e7325c5ef9db3239c4cef0b2ce61b125c46d8a"}],
      "validationKinds": ["static", "sdk", "build", "runtime", "visual"]
    },
    {
      "id": "IL-F010",
      "category": "navigation",
      "normativeStatus": "clear",
      "statement": "Tabs 使用 FloatingTabBarStyle.systemMaterial，且材质会被栏背景色或背景模糊覆盖。",
      "sources": [{"snapshotId":"component","locator":"L30-L38","sha256":"5b610a4e5158c841b53662fa45e7325c5ef9db3239c4cef0b2ce61b125c46d8a"}],
      "validationKinds": ["static", "sdk", "build", "runtime", "visual"]
    },
    {
      "id": "IL-F011",
      "category": "navigation",
      "normativeStatus": "clear",
      "statement": "AlphabetIndexer 弹窗材质与 popupBackground、popupBackgroundBlurStyle 存在互斥覆盖关系。",
      "sources": [{"snapshotId":"component","locator":"L44-L51","sha256":"5b610a4e5158c841b53662fa45e7325c5ef9db3239c4cef0b2ce61b125c46d8a"}],
      "validationKinds": ["static", "build", "runtime", "visual"]
    },
    {
      "id": "IL-F012",
      "category": "overlay",
      "normativeStatus": "clear",
      "statement": "Toast、Popup、Tips、Menu、Dialog 和 Sheet 具有各自的 systemMaterial 配置入口或默认材质策略。",
      "sources": [{"snapshotId":"component","locator":"L57-L105","sha256":"5b610a4e5158c841b53662fa45e7325c5ef9db3239c4cef0b2ce61b125c46d8a"}],
      "validationKinds": ["static", "sdk", "build", "runtime", "visual"]
    },
    {
      "id": "IL-F013",
      "category": "overlay",
      "normativeStatus": "clear",
      "statement": "弹窗普通背景色、背景模糊或大面积材质会覆盖效果或引入性能风险。",
      "sources": [{"snapshotId":"component","locator":"L61-L105","sha256":"5b610a4e5158c841b53662fa45e7325c5ef9db3239c4cef0b2ce61b125c46d8a"},{"snapshotId":"constraints","locator":"L114","sha256":"76d6de2d678f4b582a2f29b9811e1342ee895dc99fcc1c84dd20f1d881872fa7"}],
      "validationKinds": ["static", "runtime", "visual"]
