      "category": "control",
      "normativeStatus": "clear",
      "statement": "Toggle 的 Checkbox 形态当前不适配沉浸材质，应保留普通样式。",
      "sources": [{"snapshotId":"component","locator":"L139-L150","sha256":"5b610a4e5158c841b53662fa45e7325c5ef9db3239c4cef0b2ce61b125c46d8a"}],
      "validationKinds": ["static", "build", "runtime", "visual"]
    },
    {
      "id": "IL-F017",
      "category": "material-option",
      "normativeStatus": "clear",
      "statement": "materialColor 必须保留透明度；不透明颜色会遮挡材质滤镜效果。",
      "sources": [{"snapshotId":"common","locator":"L87-L91,L127","sha256":"8750a14c14240054ee597e7f389da6d78f1530a27e7f1cc8ef142ffc41d23457"}],
      "validationKinds": ["static", "runtime", "visual"]
    },
    {
      "id": "IL-F018",
      "category": "material-option",
      "normativeStatus": "clear",
      "statement": "colorInvert 只保证对资源颜色生效，硬编码颜色不能据此判定已反色。",
      "sources": [{"snapshotId":"faq","locator":"L255","sha256":"001d5f4f6c1ed902d4f881d9c90aaa1d434f24c1201e567d0daf88585403cb39"}],
      "validationKinds": ["static", "runtime", "visual"]
    },
    {
      "id": "IL-F019",
      "category": "material-option",
      "normativeStatus": "clear",
      "statement": "interactive 与 lightEffect 控制交互和流光；Button 开启流光后需同时验证原按压和悬停反馈。",
      "sources": [{"snapshotId":"common","locator":"L146-L149","sha256":"8750a14c14240054ee597e7f389da6d78f1530a27e7f1cc8ef142ffc41d23457"},{"snapshotId":"component","locator":"L112-L120","sha256":"5b610a4e5158c841b53662fa45e7325c5ef9db3239c4cef0b2ce61b125c46d8a"}],
      "validationKinds": ["static", "runtime", "visual"]
    },
    {
