      "category": "fallback",
      "normativeStatus": "clear",
      "statement": "设备不支持沉浸材质时必须保留接入前的背景、边框、布局、状态、事件和恢复路径。",
      "sources": [{"snapshotId":"compatibility","locator":"L17-L71","sha256":"c1de0cc670559c0c67b6196d378ab8d87d2594e6af2546aa65776f8e2f5381fe"}],
